results.description:
The Balaclava Detonator Skibidi Toilet is a Medium-sized Balaclava Skibidi Toilet variant that has a white toilet. The bowl is surrounded by Pipe bombs, with two placed on each side of the toilet bowl, alongside Acid barrels, which are instead affixed atop the sides of the toilet bowl, though the third is found just below the tip part of the bowl. He also features three side-legs on each side that take the appearance of Claws and to finish off, a pair of Turbines mounted on one side of the water tank.

